# T-10857 — the per-run hermetic-sandbox root glob the process-reap below identifies its targets by.
# The literal (rather than a reference) is forced by module ORDER: the sibling `_VERIFY_SANDBOX_PREFIX`
# is defined far BELOW this point. The two are held in sync by an explicit drift assertion in
