# ───────── T-11002 (SPEC-0077 §3a × T-0655) — the backstop's pre-verify RE-BASELINE ADMISSION ─────────
#
# X-0844 (kupiclub branch task/T-0240, six journal rows): a branch DISCOVERS it needs a §3a re-baseline
# BY failing the pinned check, and keeps failing while the operator diagnoses why — so by the time the
# owner-acked per-assertion waive is in hand, the repeated-abort counter has ALWAYS already tripped. The
# backstop is evaluated BEFORE verify and keys ONLY on the recorded cause fingerprint, never on whether
# the invocation MATERIALLY CHANGED, so the FIRST attempt in that branch's history to carry a proper
# re-baseline never ran. The only way past was `--ack-repeated-abort` — a BROAD counter-clearing bypass
# consumers class alongside `--no-tests` as never-self-authorized. The design therefore taught reaching
# for the blunt instrument in order to use the precise one, which is the real damage here.
#
# THE FIX IS AN ORDERING ONE, and it is deliberately NOT the other two shapes the reporter offered:
# repeat-IDENTITY is NOT made to depend on waiver SEMANTICS (that would make the fingerprint fragile),
# and the message alone would leave the structural collision standing. What is evaluated ahead of the
# backstop is the PURE predicate below — no git, no verify, no I/O — over the SAME journal rows the
# backstop walk already read. The side-effecting §3a GRANT stays exactly where it is (after verify, in
# `_land_integrate`) and remains the sole authority that waives anything: hoisting THAT would pay the
# minutes-long verify the backstop exists to avoid, on every unsafe repeat.
#
# WHY THE GUARD IS NOT DISARMED (the card's differential — a repeat that changed NOTHING must still be
# pre-empted). Three properties, each fail-closed:
#   1. STRUCTURAL. An invocation whose declaration covers ALL the recorded pinned assertions cannot be
#      the no-change repeat that produced the counted abort — had it covered them, the grant would have
#      fired and the land would not have aborted on that cause.
#   2. PINNED-ONLY. Admission requires every recorded assertion to carry the `[pinned/last-green] `
#      prefix. A CANDIDATE-suite regression is a real signal a re-baseline can NEVER waive, so a token
#      written against one buys nothing here and that streak keeps freezing.
#   3. PROVABLY-C1-ONLY. Any recorded entry this reader cannot prove assertion-bearing (`(no assertion
#      captured)`, unkeyed, unparseable) refuses admission rather than guessing its class — the reader
#      judgement `lessons/fail-closed-belongs-to-the-reader-not-the-parser.md` names, applied to a
#      journaled row where the raw entry (and with it the file-vs-layer distinction) is no longer there.

